#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:430
msgid "Restacking Graphical Elements"
msgstr "Ändra lagerordning för grafiska element"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:432
msgid ""
"Graphical elements can overlap when they are placed over the cell grid area."
" Conceptually, each graphical element occupies one layer in a stack of all "
"the elements. By default, elements which have been created more recently "
"will overlap in front of elements which were created earlier."
msgstr ""
"Grafiska element kan överlappa när de placeras ovanpå cellrutnätet. Man kan "
"se varje element som ett lager i en hög. Som standard hamnar element som "
"skapats senare framför dem som skapats tidigare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:441
msgid "Stacked graphical elements."
msgstr "Grafiska element i lager."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:445
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/graphical-elements-stacked.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> showing stacked graphical element. "
"</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/graphical-elements-stacked.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> som visar grafiska element i "
"lager.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:465
msgid ""
"The order of each element in the stack can be changed using the four menu "
"items in the context menu. The <guimenuitem>Top</guimenuitem> will bring the"
" selected element in front of all the other objects. The "
"<guimenuitem>Up</guimenuitem> menu item will bring the selected element "
"forward one layer. Conversely, the <guimenuitem>Down</guimenuitem> menu item"
" will move the selected element one layer towards the back, and the "
"<guimenuitem>Bottom</guimenuitem> menu item will palace the selected element"
" at the very back of the stack of elements. Jointly, these menu items allow "
"the user to specify exactly which order in which the graphical elements "
"should appear."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra elementens ordning i högen med de fyra alternativen i "
"snabbmenyn. <guimenuitem>Överkant</guimenuitem> placerar det markerade "
"elementet framför alla andra objekt. <guimenuitem>Upp</guimenuitem> flyttar "
"det ett lager framåt. <guimenuitem>Ner</guimenuitem> flyttar det ett lager "
"bakåt, och <guimenuitem>Underkant</guimenuitem> placerar det längst bak i "
"högen. Tillsammans låter alternativen dig bestämma exakt i vilken ordning de"
" grafiska elementen visas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:481
msgid ""
"The stacking of graphical elements in <application>Gnumeric</application> is"
" currently not working correctly. Widget elements are always placed above "
"the other elements and do not honor the same ordering scheme as the rest of "
"the elements. A large amount of work will be required to fix this and a "
"decision has been made to ignore this problem until the developers have the "
"time to fix this problem correctly."
msgstr ""
"Lagerordningen för grafiska element i <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"fungerar för närvarande inte korrekt. Gränssnittskomponenter placeras alltid"
" ovanpå övriga element och följer inte samma ordning som de andra elementen."
" Det krävs mycket arbete för att rätta till detta, så problemet lämnas tills"
" utvecklarna har tid att åtgärda det ordentligt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:496
msgid "Deleting Graphical Elements"
msgstr "Ta bort grafiska element"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:498
msgid ""
"All of the graphical elements in <application>Gnumeric</application> can be "
"deleted using the context menu. Deleting a graphical element will never "
"alter the data contents of the cells in the workbooks."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ta bort alla grafiska element i <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"via snabbmenyn. När du tar bort ett grafiskt element påverkas inte data i "
"arbetsbokens celler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:505
msgid ""
"Deleting a graphical element requires using the context menu. First the "
"mouse pointer must be placed over the graphical element. Next, the context "
"menu must be invoked by clicking with one of the secondary mouse buttons. "
"Finally, the <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> menu item must be selected by"
" placing the mouse pointer over this menu item and clicking with the primary"
" mouse button. When this menu item is selected, the graphical element will "
"disappear from the worksheet and will not be saved as part of the "
"spreadsheet file the next time the file is saved."
msgstr ""
"Du tar bort ett grafiskt element via snabbmenyn. För först muspekaren över "
"elementet och öppna snabbmenyn genom att klicka med en sekundär musknapp. "
"För sedan pekaren till menyalternativet <guimenuitem>Ta bort</guimenuitem> "
"och klicka med den primära musknappen. Elementet försvinner från "
"kalkylbladet och sparas inte i kalkylbladsfilen nästa gång du sparar den."
